[ti:Learning How to Stay V2]
[00:23.68][Verse]
[00:23.76]My phone lights up before the morning does
[00:29.40]New words arrive with names I never learned
[00:35.08]The train doors close on another version
[00:40.32]Of the city while my coffee burns
[00:46.56]I keep a map of streets that disappear
[00:51.28]In the back pocket of my coat
[00:57.24]Every headline changes shape at midnight
[01:02.88]Every promise learns to float
[01:09.04][Pre-Chorus]
[01:09.12]I run toward the skyline
[01:12.52]It moves when I get close
[01:14.60]I reach for solid ground
[01:16.72]And find another coast
[01:21.56][Chorus]
[01:21.64]I’m still learning how to stay
[01:24.32]While the world rewrites its name
[01:27.12]Every door becomes a window
[01:29.96]Every fire becomes a flame
[01:32.76]If I’m late to every future
[01:35.44]Let me be late my own way
[01:38.60]I’m still learning how to stay
[02:08.16][Verse]
[02:08.24]The kids downstairs speak in borrowed signals
[02:14.08]Laughing in a language made last week
[02:19.52]I watch their shadows cross the lobby glass
[02:25.16]And practice being small enough to breathe
[02:31.56]There’s a box of wires beneath my bed
[02:36.48]Old chargers curled like sleeping snakes
[02:42.08]I keep them like a record of the people
[02:47.72]I was before the updates changed
[02:53.72][Pre-Chorus]
[02:53.76]Maybe I was never meant
[02:56.24]To catch each passing train
[02:59.40]Maybe keeping one warm room
[03:01.20]Is not the same as staying
[03:06.04][Chorus]
[03:06.12]I’m still learning how to stay
[03:08.76]While the world rewrites its name
[03:11.60]Every door becomes a window
[03:14.40]Every fire becomes a flame
[03:17.24]If I’m late to every future
[03:19.92]Let me be late my own way
[03:23.08]I’m still learning how to stay
[03:47.32][Bridge]
[03:47.40]Who do I become tomorrow
[03:49.52]When tomorrow won’t sit still?
[03:52.52]I put both feet on the kitchen floor
[03:55.52]And let the noise pass through
[03:58.40]The kettle sings, the daylight comes
[04:01.20]My hands still know what to do
[04:05.36][Chorus]
[04:05.44]I’m still learning how to stay
[04:08.08]While the world rewrites its name
[04:10.88]Every door becomes a window
[04:13.72]Every fire becomes a flame
[04:16.52]If I’m late to every future
[04:19.20]Let me be late my own way
[04:22.40]I’m still learning how to stay
